@startuml autonomous-organization-realization
title Autonomous Organization Realization ; per ADR-ES-021 section 6 + CR-ES-021 section 13

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Organizational Objective;
:Organizational Context;
:Sense / Assess;
:Interpret;
:Decision;
:Action Selection;
:Coordination;
:Execution;
:Observe Outcome;
:Adapt;
if (Authority exceeded?) then (yes)
  :Escalate to Human / Authority;
else (no)
endif
stop

note right
  The entire progression remains bounded by organizational
  governance. Per ADR-ES-021 section 6.
end note

@enduml
